[5] Proof-angle readout
  automatic words alone are far from route-pure.
  q-threshold and q-factor/power fields reduce but do not eliminate mixed fibers.
  exact M attached to the automatic word already separates open/boundary status.
  exact M is not enough for theorem-route purity; it still needs packet labels or topology.
  the maximal non-route guarded packet signature is route-pure in this bank.
  Candidate zipper theorem:
    In any fixed automatic word fiber, the first nonzero repair cochain among exact M/q, boundary topology, C27/K33 transfer labels, tail magnitude, convergence/arc-Cech sidecars, and harmonic dual data either opens a strict component, descends to a known family, is killed by a dual certificate, or emits F7/THM-572 residual debt.
